Revision history for Test-Metrics-Any

0.02    2026-09-30
        [CHANGES]
         * General style refresh
            + Minimum perl version 5.20
            + Use subroutine signatures (mostly)
            + Minor Pod style updates
            + Swap unit tests from `Test::More` to `Test2::V0`
         * Defend unit tests against changes to perl's reporting of line
           numbers in code involving multi-line anonymous subroutines
           (Perl #24396)

0.01    2020-05-05
        First version, released on an unsuspecting world.
